{"i":37,"text":"Good job! Repeat jobs you can check go to AI. Care and decisions stay with people. Replay for a different day.","where":"ui:hati.end.good"},
{"i":38,"text":"Working Together at its best! You gave AI the repeat jobs and kept the caring for people.","where":"ui:hati.end.great"},
{"i":39,"text":"Remember: AI for repeat jobs you can check, people for care and decisions, and someone is always responsible.","where":"ui:hati.end.lesson"},
