{"i":45,"text":"The AI helper is instant at repeat jobs, but it can fail at care and judgement.","where":"ui:hati.how.ai"},
{"i":46,"text":"The Service meter drops when the AI fails on a task that needs a person.","where":"ui:hati.how.meter"},
{"i":47,"text":"A person is slower, but comforts, decides and answers for the work.","where":"ui:hati.how.person"},
{"i":48,"text":"How it works","where":"ui:hati.how.title"},
{"i":49,"text":"It is Kuya Jun's first day with the AI helper. Eight tasks land on the desk, one at a time. Send each one to the AI helper or to a person. The Service meter shows how the barangay feels. In the Arcade, the game goes on with timers, many days and a busier queue.","where":"ui:hati.introText"},
